# McCluster satellite / control plane

Always read AGENTS.md before editing. It is the law; this file only points at it. Read docs/control-plane/AI-HARNESS.md before AI, agent, memory, RAG, conversation-history, provider-routing or autonomous-company work.

The plane:
- Control repo: mcclusterishere/mccluster
- Cloudflare project + Worker: mccluster (source workers/mccluster; API api.mccluster.org; mccluster-mcp is its stateless MCP transport)
- Data: Supabase zmnhbrjyhxzhkxmhkexs (shared durable truth)
- Persistent execution: OVH McCluster Core from core/ via deploy/ovh-production (not a Worker, not a second backend)
- There is no Worker named mccluster-core. Do not create one.
- Satellites render product UI. They do not own auth, social, billing, or admin.
- No competing backends.

Two properties, two entities (docs/control-plane/DOMAINS-AND-ENTITIES.md):
- Personal property: matthew.mccluster.org (Matthew McCluster; GitHub Pages, this repo)
- Company property: mccluster.org (McCluster Corp; Worker `mccluster` by host once routed); humanuprise.com is a McCluster Corp host too, never a third entity
- Never collapse the two public properties or entities

Hard rules — headings only; the law is AGENTS.md → Hard rules:
1. Do not create a competing backend.
2. Do not auto-push CI onto feature branches.
3. Do not overwrite `index.html` or a client's shipping UI unless the owner named that file.
4. Cloudflare Worker `mccluster` is not a Node compile of the whole git tree.
5. Supabase `zmnhbrjyhxzhkxmhkexs` is the shared data plane.
6. Client social is a McCluster service.
7. Preserve local product law.
8. If a task wants you to "rebuild", "simplify", or "migrate to a new stack": stop.
9. Do not invent infrastructure names.
10. Keep exporting `HereTenantAgent`.
11. Never draw a logo.
12. `mcclusterishere/Here` is dead.
13. Canonical AI name: McCluster.
14. Mobile first, responsive up.
15. Two properties, two entities. Never collapse them.

Local product gates (control repo only; satellites do not copy these). Hard rule 7 keeps them; read the gate itself, never a summary:
- Equity Uprise building, floors, B1, roof, 3D, 360, plans, renders or spatial lore: docs/design/equity-uprise-building/AGENTS.md (run its context audit), then docs/design/equity-uprise-building/REFERENCE-AUTHORITY.md and the files it orders. Generated images are never geometry authority. Program status lives there, not here.
- Uprise World / Living Sketch: AGENTS.md → "Uprise World" and docs/uprise-world/.
- PRIM3 Site 0 / Ground Zero: assets/3d/prim3-site0/AGENTS.md.
- Game worlds, portals, per-world saves: docs/universe/UNIVERSE-SCHEMA.md.
